# Build context of backend/Dockerfile (T-PLT-25, RNF-PLT-01, design.md §3.4.2).
# No environment file ever enters an image, .env.example included (no exception on purpose:
# Compose bind-mounts it where a test needs it).
**/.env*
# Version control and local tooling.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
# Local virtualenv (the image builds its own in /opt/venv) and generated files.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/coverage
**/.coverage
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
# The image does not need its own recipe.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
